    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL21tYml6X2dpZi8xcnJkdFZxbjNZRWdrY1ZnTmliNHJrUDJKUThBdFRWQW9ySWxmMEZxZmliSHY3SVVpYXpJSGlhWnhyRWFYUHo1RVdpYzEwbU1kYUlXT29Fa04zSHZVOEhpYlFFZy82NDA_d3hfZm10PWdpZiZ0cD13ZWJwJnd4ZnJvbT01Jnd4X2xhenk9MSNpbWdJbmRleD0w"></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鲍鲍（微博：不详）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>死光（微博：不详）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>莱特（微博：不详）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>肖璐（微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1639395711" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1639395711"><span>那就肖璐吧</span></a><span>）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>大家好，这里是编辑箱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「整点KTV」！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将特邀鲍鲍老师一起录制一期「整点KTV」，作为刚刚以Rapper身份参加完音乐节的音乐人，鲍鲍老师将带着他的态度来迎接大家的歌声的挑战！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次邀请到的评委嘉宾，有新有旧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「说唱巅峰对决」现场哈评人鲍鲍老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>「整点KTV」前任冠军死光老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>「要不整点」常驻嘉宾莱特老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个阵容，各位朋友们，和说唱明星、台湾艺人同台献丑的机会，let's go！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#【整点KTV】鲍鲍来做客</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2t_tu7zzGD4Lo7P_Auv0jkYz7H.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>OP：《Pan Ron》Pan Ron</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>EP：《快乐崇拜》潘玮柏/张韶涵</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期制作：肖璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期策划：肖璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期剪辑：肖璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面制作：肖璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐校对：椅子</span></p>]]></description>
